Retail Sales Data Analysis Project
1. Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing retail sales data to understand sales performance, customer purchasing patterns, and business trends using PostgreSQL and Tableau.
2. Project Objectives
Analyze overall retail sales performance.
Identify purchasing trends.
Understand product and category performance.
Analyze customer purchasing behaviour.
Create an interactive Tableau dashboard.
3. Tools & Technologies
PostgreSQL – SQL queries and data analysis.
Tableau – Interactive dashboards and visualization.
CSV – Dataset storage and handling.
4. Project Files
File Name	Description
retail_sales_project.csv	Retail sales dataset
sql_project.sql	SQL analysis queries
Retail Sales Performance Analysis_Tableau Dashboard.twbx	Tableau dashboard
5. Analysis Performed
Sales performance analysis.
Product category analysis.
Customer purchasing behaviour.
Sales trend analysis.
Business performance visualization.
6. Dashboard
An interactive Tableau dashboard was developed to visualize retail sales performance and support business decision-making.
7. Key Learning Outcomes
Practiced SQL queries using PostgreSQL.
Improved data analysis skills.
Learned interactive dashboard development.
Developed practical business analysis skills.
